  << /ActualText (I\047m a UI\057UX designer and brand designer based in Pune\054 Maharashtra\056 I have done my BFA Applied arts from MIT World Peace University\054 Pune\nI\047m drawn to UI\057UX because I love understanding what people need\054 even when they don\031t say it\056 I enjoy uncovering quiet pain points\054 making sense of human behavior\054 and transforming those insights into digital experiences that feel intuitive\054 delightful\054 and meaningful\056)
